[{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"仙人昔返上清家，留下仙坛号紫霞。\n世人不识蓬莱树，道士空餐松柏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1083,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"郡西山畔旧禅宫，朝暮风烟多不同。\n已见楼台翠微里，更闻钟鼓白云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1084,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其六","author":"何景明","text":"震雷山头石潭水，夜夜蛟龙行雨归。\n青春下与沧溟会，白日常闻霹雳飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1085,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其七","author":"何景明","text":"楚关申戌郁茫茫，野草春沙更断肠。\n山头僧住何年砦，山下人耕古战场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1086,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其八","author":"何景明","text":"故谢城边溪水流，郢中风物更堪愁。\n行人欲问阳春曲，此地犹传白雪楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1087,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别相饯诸友","author":"何景明","text":"双井山边送客时，满林风雪倍相思。\n西行万里遥回首，太华终南落日迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1088,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人夜宿","author":"何景明","text":"相逢犹忆十年前，青草书堂溪水边。\n四海交游今殆半，几人风雨对床眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1089,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题冯大京画兰","author":"何景明","text":"雨叶风花独柰寒，围春不借曲阑干。\n国香空谷无人见，映玉辉金画里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1090,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"适坚山寺","author":"何景明","text":"谁谓高僧不可逢，出城西望有云松。\n骑驴不畏青泥坂，柱杖遥寻碧玉峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1091,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"溪上雨色晚来频，枝头花朵太禁春。\n满林熳烂谁觉汝，一树分明独恼人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1092,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"连朝风急雨滂沱，树头叶暗花不多。\n纵使明朝风雨息，苍苔狼藉柰愁何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1093,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"昨朝日照花尽开，今朝雨多花可哀。\n由来落花无根蒂，随风吹去又吹来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1094,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"正月已放山丹花，二月桃杏似云霞。\n城中少年紫骝马，日暮来寻碧玉家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1095,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"郭外春风次第来，杏花开后桃花开。\n近城早花开已谢，狂风猛雨更相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1096,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其六","author":"何景明","text":"红花紫蕊千万枝，日夜雨打更风吹。\n牡丹芍药莫太骤，暖日晴烟开不迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1097,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中看花七首 其七","author":"何景明","text":"牡丹虽迟是花王，芍药留之殿春光。\n好花元待后时发，秾李妖桃空自狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1098,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贾西谷邀饮山寺朝信不至诗以促之","author":"何景明","text":"广文邀客寺亭幽，此是春山第二游。\n立马望君君不到，不知城市为谁留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1099,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任洪器草亭四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"蔀薝当午溪云度，花重寒枝阁晓庭。\n芳草闭门春寂寂，东风吹雨半池青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1100,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任洪器草亭四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"蔷薇深院无行迹，风到闲门扫绿苔。\n明月满庭香袭袭，野塘新水藕花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1101,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任洪器草亭四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"绕屋南山秋色静，数枝寒菊一篱烟。\n酒醒读罢秋声赋，风落松梢响石泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1102,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任洪器草亭四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"门外水流云自起，雪峰半出草堂西。\n孤舟欲作山阴梦，月冷梅寒共一溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1103,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳豫之小画四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"溪上水生茅屋凉，溪边风急树颠狂。\n山中车马何曾到，秪有云松尽日苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1104,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳豫之小画四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"碧江楼阁夕阳边，万壑千峰生暮烟。\n江上长松一千尺，月明常系打鱼船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1105,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳豫之小画四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"百尺孤城对碧山，层层楼观倚云间。\n水明沙白风涛静，更有何人到此关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1106,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳豫之小画四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"树下茅斋当昼清，江边寺阁倚新晴。\n苍苔石径无人到，独有幽人江上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1107,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕怀都下之游五首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"忆昨长安元夕来，五侯弦管上楼台。\n已见炬如千树列，更看灯似百花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1108,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕怀都下之游五首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"龙岫层城接御沟，香车宝勒夜深游。\n花坊竞买千金带，绮陌皆悬五色毬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1109,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕怀都下之游五首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"夹路香尘夜不开，万人争道看灯来。\n金波宛转千门里，银汉逶迤一道回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1110,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕怀都下之游五首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"紫禁烟花一万层，鳌山云里见崚嶒。\n繁星散作宫中炬，明月来为殿上灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1111,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕怀都下之游五首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"白马金珂上苑东，六街歌舞散香风。\n豪游已作三年梦，愁对春灯此夜红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1112,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题潘秀才吹笛画扇","author":"何景明","text":"幽人横吹沧江静，满江月白青山映。\n好作穿云裂石声，夜长恐有蛟龙听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1113,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岳阳庞推官四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"君因谪宦留南郡，予亦罢官归故乡。\n同是凤凰池上客，江湖千里转堪伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1114,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岳阳庞推官四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"洞庭湖边花柳新，岳阳楼上更逢春。\n閒来载酒题诗去，还似当时贾舍人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岳阳庞推官四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"三载江城佐郡郎，十年天上旧鹓行。\n曾持画省郎官笔，况著瑶墀近侍裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄岳阳庞推官四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"湖水春来不见沙，九疑南望是天涯。\n轩辕台上清风树，湘女祠边日暮花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情","author":"何景明","text":"秋风袅袅生罗衣，美人夜泣红烛微。\n郎骑白马临邛去，楼上年年燕子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚至昌平寺中","author":"何景明","text":"度尽青溪十里霜，寒芜落日下苍茫。\n山城薄酒无钱买，晚饭僧家石耳香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中漫兴","author":"何景明","text":"长安雪花乱如云，复道层城望不分。\n行客遥传五侯宅，画楼丝管昼纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写情","author":"何景明","text":"莫将锦瑟怨年华，柳絮飘零梦谢家。\n小院回廊镇春昼，何人来为扫庭花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送乡人还","author":"何景明","text":"杨柳花飞芜草青，故乡南望几长亭。\n城边客散重回首，愁见孤鸿落晚汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻歌","author":"何景明","text":"明月暂随秦弄玉，碧空遥度楚行云。\n莫言此曲终堪听，孔雀东南各自分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸将入朝歌十二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"北扫燕齐南楚吴，风吹杀气散舆图。\n蓬莱山下朝诸将，天子戎衣受虏俘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸将入朝歌十二首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"群公陪宴柏梁台，殿上传呼万寿杯。\n元戎节钺来江上，使者楼船泛海回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸将入