。\n秦女箫中明月度，凤凰楼上彩云回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁内杏花","author":"何景明","text":"东掖杏花开不迟，日边春色独先知。\n未荐玉盘千岁实，空看仙阁五云枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙太史宅赠宫挥使二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"壮士承恩天上还，黄云白雪暗西山。\n破虏未传青海曲，封侯须到玉门关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙太史宅赠宫挥使二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"白马骍弓出蓟门，相逢意气倒金尊。\n功勋要识将军吕，文字先看太史孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠薛君采二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"五花似玉麒麟骨，八尺如龙騕袅身。\n千金台上求非易，万马群中认未真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠薛君采二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"尔梦仙人海上行，蓬莱清浅不胜情。\n金门再见东方朔，笑指蟠桃花更生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送韩汝庆还关中二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"六月西山雷雨低，长安城中十日泥。\n君骑鸿鹄冥冥去，此地愁看燕雀栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京十六夜曲四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"御河桥畔千尺台，燕京女儿踏歌来。\n台上歌钟日夕起，桥头酒垆深夜开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京十六夜曲四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"万岁山头锁玉楼，十王馆中人不游。\n中宵金鼓云间动，翠辇龙衣过五侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京十六夜曲四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"九衢车马似山河，万金买灯不道多。\n已留华月照歌舞，更放香风吹绮罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京十六夜曲四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"月高罢游关九关，暗尘吹污香雾鬟。\n谁家少年亦太恶，拾著金钿不肯还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1142,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"六月十一日苦热，夺伏争秋番太强。\n燕京何限好楼阁，袒走狂呼无地凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1143,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"日午放朝车马频，中天风火促飙轮。\n侯宫戚馆冰山冷，赤日黄埃渴杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1144,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"宫里传冰赐从官，含霜弄雪白云寒。\n银床昼锁琉璃井，玉殿阴沉玛瑙盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1145,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"午门朝罢午时过，千官万马汗成河。\n莫道宫中爱长昼，长昼宫中乐事多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1146,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"西山松柏千丈台，阴崖脚踏层冰开。\n岩楼洞阁生霜雪，触热冲炎谁为来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1147,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其六","author":"何景明","text":"长安万家悬甑里，风捲尘沙当昼起。\n五侯堂上冰成山，朝见成山暮成水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1148,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其七","author":"何景明","text":"城西山峻火云峰，丹梯无路蹑芙蓉。\n白石寺前堪避暑，昨朝雷拔殿坛松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1149,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其八","author":"何景明","text":"赤地骄阳草不生，河潭霹雳懒龙惊。\n弯弓后羿非夸父，莫放青天十日行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1150,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其九","author":"何景明","text":"昼夜蚊蝇飞满天，穿窗扑帐搅人眠。\n乘炎趁热虽吾畏，露打霜飘不汝怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1151,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行十首 其十","author":"何景明","text":"胡马炎天动万群，昨传辽水杀将军。\n王师六月歼猃狁，兵气遥蒸瀚海云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1152,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内阁荷花二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"谁送仙葩此地栽，綵云飞掌对蓬莱。\n雕阑玉槛围花发，不放金盘十丈开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1153,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内阁荷花二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"风吹菡萏并头开，水照金鱼队队回。\n映日跳波珠易碎，接云步障锦成堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1154,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送巩丞之金坛因讯养和","author":"何景明","text":"巩丞若问金坛宰，为见风流御史才。\n到日琴堂定无事，松厅竹槛对江开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1155,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨望西山","author":"何景明","text":"碧山鸣雨过嵯峨，湖水风增万丈波。\n千尺浮图清暑殿，高窗白石细盘萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1156,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王提举","author":"何景明","text":"日出帆高烟水空，岭云遥在粤天东。\n此行不为浮江兴，他日须传煮海功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1157,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东岩亭","author":"何景明","text":"卜筑东岩白石矼，孤亭袅袅出烟江。\n细分杨柳开风槛，倒影扶桑坐日窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1158,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"椒轩","author":"何景明","text":"春开轩地引红椒，锦树西江望不遥。\n当户疏帘看结实，背冈茅屋忆行条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1159,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄少谷山人二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"武夷九曲上仙庭，锦叠青天万仞屏。\n下望神人钓鳌石，北风吹雾海冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1160,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]